  "details": "Version w_2020.1.1p2.1 \nHello & sorry if this has been posted already, but I'm currently having an issue with the \"favourite avatar\" list being completely inaccessible for some reason. The public, legacy etc. avatar lists are working fine, it's just that list that's missing. I've already cleared cache & deleted local data & tried the game on a different pc to no avail. The issue started about 1-2 days after last small update, don't know if it's connected to it. It's also weird that some people have this bug & some people don't. I've attached a pic to show the missing list.",
